{
  "title": "Dua for the 23rd Night of Ramadhan",
  "data": "يَا رَبَّ لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ وَجَاعِلَهَا خَيْرًا مِّنْ اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ وَرَبَّ اللَّيْلِ وَالنَّهَارِ وَالْجِبَالِ وَالْبِحَارِ وَالظُّلَمِ وَالْاَنْوَارِ وَالْاَرْضِ وَالسَّمَاۤءِ\nYAA RABBA LAYLATIL QADRI WA JAA-I'LAHAA KHAYRAM MIN ALFI SHAHRIN WA RABBAL LAYLI WAN NAHAARI WAL JIBAALI WAL BIHAARI WAZ ZULAMI WAL ANWAARI WAL ARDI WAS SAMAAA-I\nO Lord of the Night of Decree, Who made it better than a thousand months! O Lord of night and day, mountains and seas, darkness and light, the earth and the heavens!\nيَا بَارِئُ يَا مُصَوِّرُ يَا حَنَّانُ يَا مَنَّانُ يَا اَللهُ يَا رَحْمٰنُ يَا اَللهُ يَا قَيُّوْمُ يَا اَللهُ يَا بَدِيْعُ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ يَا اَللهُ لَكَ الْاَسْمَاۤءُ الْحُسْنٰى وَالْاَمْثَالُ الْعُلْيَا وَالْكِبْرِيَاۤءُ وَالْاٰلَاۤءُ\nYAA BAARI-U' YAA MUSAWWIR YAA HANNAAN YAA MANNAAN, YAA ALLAAH YAA RAHMAAN, YAA ALLAAH YAA QAYYOOM, YAA ALLAAH YAA BADEE-U', YAA ALLAAH YAA ALLAAH YAA ALLAAH, LAKAL ASMAAA-UL HUSNAA WAL AMTHAALUL U'LYAA WAL KIBRIYAAA-U WAL AALAAA-U\nO Fashioner! O Shaper! O All-tender! O All-favoring! O Allah, O All-beneficent! O Allah, O Self-subsisting! O Allah, O Wondrous Originator! O Allah, O Allah, O Allah! To You belong the Most Excellent Names, the most exalted attributes, greatness, and bounties.\nاَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاَنْ تَجْعَلَ اسْمِيْ فِيْ هٰذِهِ اللَّيْلَةِ فِي السُّعَدَاۤءِ وَرُوْحِيْ مَعَ الشُّهَدَاۤءِ وَاِحْسَانِيْ فِيْ عِلِّيِّيْنَ وَاِسَاۤءَتِيْ مَغْفُوْرَةً\nAS-ALUKA AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA AN TAJ-A'LAS-MEE FEE HAAZIHIL LAYLATI FIS SU-A'DAAA-I WA ROOHEE MA-A'SH SHUHADAAA-I WA IHSAANEE FEE I'LLIYYEEN WA ISAAA-ATEE MAGHFOORAH\nI ask You to bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, and to include my name this night among the happy ones, my soul with the martyrs, my good deeds in the highest Illiyyin, and my wrongdoing forgiven,\nوَاَنْ تَهَبَ لِيْ يَقِيْنًا تُبَاشِرُ بِهٖ قَلْبِيْ وَاِيْمَانًا يُذْهِبُ الشَّكَّ عَنِّيْ وَتُرْضِيَنِيْ بِمَا قَسَمْتَ لِيْ وَاٰتِنَا فِي الدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِي الْاٰخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً وَقِنَا عَذَابَ النَّارِ الْحَرِيْقِ\nWA AN TAHABA LEE YAQEENAN TUBAASHIRU BIHI QALBEE WA EEMAANAN YUZHIBUSH SHAKKA A'NNEE WA TURDIYANEE BIMAA QASAMTA LEE, WA AATINAA FID DUNYAA HASANATAN WA FIL AAKHIRATI HASANATAN WA QINAA A'ZAABAN NAARIL HAREEQ\nand to grant me certitude that fills my heart, and faith that removes doubt from me, and to make me content with what You have apportioned for me; and grant us good in this world and good in the Hereafter, and protect us from the torment of the burning Fire,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ فِيْهَا ذِكْرَكَ وَشُكْرَكَ وَالرَّغْبَةَ اِلَيْكَ وَالْاِنَابَةَ وَالتَّوْبَةَ وَالتَّوْفِيْقَ لِمَا وَفَّقْتَ لَهٗ مُحَمَّدًا وَاٰلَ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWARZUQNEE FEEHAA ZIKRAKA WA SHUKRAKA WAR RAGHBATA ILAYKA WAL INAABATA WAT TAWBATA WAT TAWFEEQA LIMAA WAFFAQTA LAHU MUHAMMADAN WA AALA MUHAMMADIN A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nand grant me this night Your remembrance and Your thanks, and desire for You, and turning to You in repentance, and success in that to which You granted success to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, peace be upon them."
}
